▶ harness conformance: pi
  ✔ 1. one turn_end per turn (685.573375ms)
  ✔ 2. an interrupt mid-turn ends the turn; the next send works in the same session (109.588583ms)
  ✖ 3. tool names are normalized (45.8765ms) # pi's built-in shell tool is `bash`, not `Bash`; the contract keeps name = bareToolName(rawName), so it stays `bash` (MCP prefixes are stripped)
  ✔ 4. tool_result is correlated by id (66.406ms)
  ✔ 5. every error kind surfaces as turn_end.ok=false with the right kind (154.253209ms)
