  ✔ 7. a harness crash is reported as crash and the session can be restarted (108.154833ms)
  ✖ 8. credential isolation: a tokenFd token never reaches argv, child env or events (1.231083ms) # SWAP-GATE BLOCKER: pi takes its credential only from argv, env (inherited by its bash tool) or auth.json (readable by its tools); no fd handoff, so the adapter refuses tokenFd (see harness/pi.mjs)
  ✔ 9. secrets in tool inputs are redacted in narrator output (132.392125ms)
